    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*The Tales From The Other Side DEMO includes the first chapter in the story.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUR NEW SIMULATION PROGRAM: </strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894870/extras/f1e87f212da495c01361ea74536fa70c.avif?t=1749425259\" width=800 height=206 /></span>In Tales From The Other Side, you wake up in an old attic in the &quot;FLYPSIDE&quot;, a parallel dimension to ours, centuries ahead in the future of an alternate timeline...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894870/extras/dcafcb67d15ca857bed1b617a72d6ede.avif?t=1749425259\" width=800 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With no memories of anything beforehand, you have only one thing on your mind. You need to go back. Back to the abyss below you! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT CAN YOU EXPECT FROM THIS PROGRAM:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894870/extras/d2bc8f1cc60681a25e8e2fed49c4ae52.avif?t=1749425259\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simplified non violent turn-based  RPG! (WOW) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use ACTION COMMANDS to attack and defend yourself! (HELL YEAH!) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be friendly with engaging conversations! (OH MY) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or do nothing and tire your enemies out to win! (FINALLY SOME CONVINIENCE) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the likes of &quot;UNDERTALE&quot; and &quot;Mario &amp; Luigi: Superstar saga&quot;! (YEAH I CAN TELL)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plethora of weird secrets and knickknacks! (WHAT?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weird yet charismatic set of characters! (I HOPE THAT'S THE CASE)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack by Levc EGM! (WHO?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the game was done by him too (I GUESS???)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Joe's (I...UH... WHAT?)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A friend by your side (... I UH, I'M GOING HOME YEAH...)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894870/extras/72fbfaa56163c74becb4cc716b9d9e11.avif?t=1749425259\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains bright and colorful imagery and flashing lights... So please take this into account before playing!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*The Tales From The Other Side DEMO includes the first chapter in the story.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUR NEW SIMULATION PROGRAM: </strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894870/extras/f1e87f212da495c01361ea74536fa70c.avif?t=1749425259\" width=800 height=206 /></span>In Tales From The Other Side, you wake up in an old attic in the &quot;FLYPSIDE&quot;, a parallel dimension to ours, centuries ahead in the future of an alternate timeline...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894870/extras/dcafcb67d15ca857bed1b617a72d6ede.avif?t=1749425259\" width=800 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With no memories of anything beforehand, you have only one thing on your mind. You need to go back. Back to the abyss below you! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT CAN YOU EXPECT FROM THIS PROGRAM:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894870/extras/d2bc8f1cc60681a25e8e2fed49c4ae52.avif?t=1749425259\" data-has-big width=800 height=274 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simplified non violent turn-based  RPG! (WOW) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use ACTION COMMANDS to attack and defend yourself! (HELL YEAH!) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be friendly with engaging conversations! (OH MY) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or do nothing and tire your enemies out to win! (FINALLY SOME CONVINIENCE) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the likes of &quot;UNDERTALE&quot; and &quot;Mario &amp; Luigi: Superstar saga&quot;! (YEAH I CAN TELL)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plethora of weird secrets and knickknacks! (WHAT?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weird yet charismatic set of characters! (I HOPE THAT'S THE CASE)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack by Levc EGM! (WHO?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the game was done by him too (I GUESS???)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Joe's (I...UH... WHAT?)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A friend by your side (... I UH, I'M GOING HOME YEAH...)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894870/extras/72fbfaa56163c74becb4cc716b9d9e11.avif?t=1749425259\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains bright and colorful imagery and flashing lights... So please take this into account before playing!</p>",
